Package: uu-remote-ubuntu-bridge-installer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: cnsunfishegg <297799715+cnsunfishegg@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash, python3, ca-certificates, util-linux
Homepage: https://github.com/cnsunfishegg/uu-remote-ubuntu-bridge
Description: UU Remote Ubuntu Bridge setup bundle for Ubuntu 26.04
 This package installs a source-only setup command for the unofficial fork of
 Lachlan Chen's UU Remote Ubuntu Bridge. Open "UU Remote Setup" in the app
 menu as a logged-in desktop user after installation, or run
 uu-remote-bridge-setup without sudo. Setup downloads the official UU
 installer separately and requires network access and account sign-in.
 No proprietary NetEase binaries or user account data are bundled.
